<title>POLAND: Poland offers PLN 700 mln 10-year bonds October 8.</title>
<headline>Poland offers PLN 700 mln 10-year bonds October 8.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poland will offer 700 million zlotys of its floating 10-year bonds on October 8, the National Bank of Poland said.</p>
<p>The tranche will be part of the goverment's two billion zloty 10-year bond offer maturing on October 18, 2006.</p>
<p>The settlement date for this auction is October 17, 1996.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
